{"term": {"label": "義", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-i", "title": "梁惠王上", "description": "孟子見梁惠王。王曰：「叟不遠千里而來，亦將有以利吾國乎？」\n孟子對曰：「王何必曰利？亦有仁義而已矣。王曰『何以利吾國』？大夫曰『何以利吾家』？士庶人曰『何以利吾身』？上下交征利而國危矣。萬乘之國弒其君者，必千乘之家；千乘之國弒其君者，必百乘之家。萬取千焉，千取百焉，不為不多矣。苟為後義而先利，不奪不饜。未有仁而遺其親者", "occurrences": 7, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "乘", "id": "乘"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "今", "id": "今"}, {"form": "利", "id": "利"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "在", "id": "在"}, {"form": "孝", "id": "孝"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "悌", "id": "悌"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "敵", "id": "敵"}, {"form": "日", "id": "日"}, {"form": "明", "id": "明"}, {"form": "步", "id": "步"}, {"form": "為", "id": "爲"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}], "edges": [{"weight": 3.6375861597263857, "source": "乘", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.028148247292285, "source": "敵", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 4.330733340286331, "source": "悌", "target": "孝"}, {"weight": 3.2321210516182215, "source": "悌", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 3.6375861597263857, "source": "悌", "target": "日"}, {"weight": 3.2321210516182215, "source": "孝", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 3.6375861597263857, "source": "孝", "target": "日"}, {"weight": 1.33500106673234, "source": "君", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 1.8458266904983307, "source": "君", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.9444389791664403, "source": "君", "target": "明"}, {"weight": 1.0473189942805592, "source": "利", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 0.3541718137206139, "source": "利", "target": "爲"}, {"weight": 1.55814461804655, "source": "利", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.7212954278522306, "source": "政", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.21046980408624, "source": "政", "target": "今"}, {"weight": 0.131028262406404, "source": "爲", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 0.6418538861723947, "source": "爲", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.7404661748405046, "source": "爲", "target": "明"}, {"weight": 0.6418538861723947, "source": "爲",